{"id":"2025a44b99a9bc8b","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Parameter Definable Set","display":"df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set — ZFC Model8 Parameter Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set — ZFC Model8 Parameter Definable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-definable]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-parameters]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-parameter-definable-set — ZFC Model8 Parameter Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"58-df-definable\">58-df-definable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"453a692642e0bff9\" href=\"?note=453a692642e0bff9\" title=\"58-df-parameters\">58-df-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,M,L,r,m,p,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\">\\(X,M,L,r,m,p,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\)</span> (candidate relation, structure, arities, parameter tuple, and satisfaction witnesses)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (universe selector supplied by the structure used in satisfaction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\)</span> (exact semantic predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ParameterDefinableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ParameterDefinableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ParameterDefinableSet}_S(X,M,L,r,p,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;r\\in\\omega\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(p\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^m)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^r\\\\&amp;\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^r\\;\\Bigl(\\bar a\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land\\forall i\\in r\\;s(v_i)=\\bar a(i)\\\\&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\\forall j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;s(v_{r+j})=p(j)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ParameterDefinableSet}_S(X,M,L,r,p,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;r\\in\\omega\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(p\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^m)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^r\\\\&amp;\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^r\\;\\Bigl(\\bar a\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land\\forall i\\in r\\;s(v_i)=\\bar a(i)\\\\&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\\forall j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;s(v_{r+j})=p(j)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The repaired atom defines an actual set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>-tuples, rather than a uniquely definable point. Formula syntax, universe membership, assignments, and satisfaction witnesses are all explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","loca